flowchart TD
  Start[New task] --> Check[Detect capabilities]
  Check --> Read{Can inspect sources?}
  Read -->|yes| Inspect[Inspect mode]
  Read -->|no| Context[Use minimal context]
  Inspect --> Write{Can update target?}
  Write -->|yes| Execute[Execute mode]
  Write -->|no| Draft[Draft mode]
  Context --> Handoff[Handoff mode]
  Execute --> Validate[Validate and collect receipts]
  Draft --> Validate
  Handoff --> Validate
  Validate --> Report[Report labels, receipts, risks, next move]
